            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A vacuum cleaner (10, 110) includes a base (14) having an agitator chamber (38, 138) and a suction nozzle opening (42, 153) in fluid communication with the agitator chamber (38, 138). A brushroll (60, 160, 260) is positioned within the agitator chamber (38, 138) for rotational movement. The brushroll (60, 160, 260) includes a brush dowel (62, 162, 262) provided with a plurality of bristles (72, 172). The brush dowel (62, 162, 262) has a plurality of ribs (80, 180, 280).</p>
            </abstract>
